DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin writer\, Donna Pecore\, and the Budlo
 ng Woods Writers as they celebrate and read from their seventh anthology o
 f poetry and prose\, Bon Appétit : Herbivore\, Carnivore\, Omnivore. This
  collection is indeed a feast for the eye\, ear\, mind\, and heart. It has
  something for everyone: essays\, poetry\, memoir\, fiction\, non-fiction\
 , and artwork from thirty seasoned and emerging writers. --Gay Guard-Chamb
 erlin\, author of Red Thread Through a Rusty Needle (New Wind Publishing) 
 As we settle into summer\, con\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocom
 mons.com/events/6a3b09cfc134422d50e9e7a9
